{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "6ba592ea-89a5-8f54-8406-477cb56595ee",
  "created_at": "2026-02-25T10:08:22-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Deirdre McCarthy",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:06:04-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:06:07-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Yes. I want to report a pothole. A big one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:06:12-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can take that. Where's the pothole?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:06:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "123 Eustis Avenue. In the street, in front. Historic Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:06:21-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 123 Eustis Avenue. Got it. And you sound like you're on speaker, is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:06:28-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. I am in the passenger seat. My friend drives. We are stopped now. [pause] She hears too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:06:35-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Tell me about the hole. How big are we talking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:06:40-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Very deep. It can swallow a tire. The whole tire. We hit it this morning, and the car shook very bad."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:06:48-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ouch. Is that new, or has it been there a while?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:06:53-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is worse now. After the storm, last weekend. Saturday into Sunday. The water, the ice, and now the hole is bigger."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:07:02-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that freeze and thaw does it. Alright, I'm noting a deep pothole, front of 123 Eustis, got worse after the weekend nor'easter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:07:11-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Please put the street on the repair list. Please. It is not good, this street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:07:18-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put in the request now so a crew can look at it. I can't tell you the exact day they'll get there, they've got a lot of holes after this one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:07:30-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[line breaks up] ...another question. The car. If the car is broken from the hole, does the city pay? The tire, the wheel?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:07:39-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you cut out for a second. You're asking if the city reimburses for car damage?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:07:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Reimburse. Does the city pay for it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:07:50-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's a claim process for that, but I don't handle it here. I can send you over to the right office, or take your name and number and have someone call you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:08:02-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take the number. Please. I am Deirdre McCarthy. M-C-C-A-R-T-H-Y."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:08:06-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Deirdre McCarthy. And the number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:08:09-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0196."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:08:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 401-555-0196. I'll pass that along with the pothole report. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:08:15-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. Just fix the hole. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T10:08:18-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it. Drive safe, and thanks for calling."
    }
  ],
